** sch_path: /foss/designs/sg13cmos5l_cm_ip__single2diff2single_sudelbuecher/sudelbuecher/design_considerations/class_ab_pad_driver/xschem/tb_d2s_loadcomp_step.sch
**.subckt tb_d2s_loadcomp_step
Vdd vdd GND 3.3
Vcm vref GND 1.65
Xb vdd GND vbp vbn vbpc vbnc vabp vabn d2s_bias
Xd vdd GND vinp vinn vref vout vout vbp vbn vbpc vbnc vabp vabn d2s_loadcomp
Vd dp GND pulse({-vstep} {vstep} 1u 1n 1n 4u 8u)
Ep vinp vref dp GND 0.5
En vinn vref dp GND -0.5
CL vout GND 100p
**** begin user architecture code

.lib cornerMOShv.lib mos_tt
.lib cornerRES.lib res_typ
.lib cornerCAP.lib cap_typ
.param vstep=0.5
.control
tran 2n 9u
meas tran vlo find v(vout) at=0.99u
meas tran vhi find v(vout) at=4.9u
if $?batchmode = 0
  plot v(vout) v(vinp) v(vinn)
end
.endc

**** end user architecture code
**.ends

